; Do NOT set script-shell to PowerShell here — it is committed to Git and breaks Vercel/Linux builds
; (npm would try to spawn C:\Windows\...\powershell.exe on servers where that path does not exist).
;
; If your project path contains "&" on Windows and npm scripts fail locally, set this only on your machine:
;   npm config set script-shell "C:\\Windows\\System32\\WindowsPowerShell\\v1.0\\powershell.exe"
; Or clone/work from a path without "&".
